### Day 6 - Support Desk API test file
### Run the app first:  mvn spring-boot:run   (base URL http://localhost:8080)
### Click "Send Request" above each request (VS Code REST Client).


### 1. Health endpoint  -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health


### 2. About endpoint  -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/about


### 3. Get all tickets  -> 200 (JSON array)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets


### 4. Get one existing ticket  -> 200 (single object)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T001


### 5. Get one missing ticket  -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T999


### 6. Create a valid ticket  -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer not responding",
  "description": "Office printer on level 3 is not printing.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "createdBy": "aisyah@example.com"
}


### 7. Create an invalid ticket - blank required fields  -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}
